menu "Reflow Controller Test Configuration"

    config REFLOW_ENABLE_UNIT_TESTS
        bool "Enable automated Unity unit tests on boot"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, Unity unit tests across all 11 modules will be compiled
            and executed at boot time before starting application tasks.
            Disable this for production firmware builds to reduce flash size, RAM usage,
            and boot latency.

    config REFLOW_HALT_ON_TEST_FAILURE
        bool "Halt boot sequence if any unit test fails"
        default y
        depends on REFLOW_ENABLE_UNIT_TESTS
        help
            If enabled, the controller will halt and enter an infinite loop on test failure,
            preventing faulty firmware from driving heaters or SSRs.

endmenu
